      "en": "Philip went down to the city of Samaria and proclaimed to them the Christ.",
      "ko": "빌립이 사마리아 성에 내려가 그리스도를 백성에게 전파하니",
      "source_text_hash": "d36b2f35db9eff3955c637b46add92f679add7953fed0e6a391500f5b6cbf819",
      "translation_text_hash": "ab691d2c0e4c8c3594f18a9ae295439f0c12c60ea52d9af524180c7ad8db4155",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
