      "en": "For unclean spirits came out of many of those who had them. They came out, crying with a loud voice. Many who had been paralyzed and lame were healed.",
      "ko": "많은 사람에게 붙었던 더러운 귀신들이 크게 소리를 지르며 나가고 또 많은 중풍병자와 앉은뱅이가 나으니",
      "source_text_hash": "37609f044413fcb14519467f3a260a63c4c903cb95885938e7e865c3af66b286",
      "translation_text_hash": "cb66e61181c79710f6ccc7739386dd022b9f9222c3790cd650e4f3c62d08b41e",
