      "en": "Simon himself also believed. Being baptized, he continued with Philip. Seeing signs and great miracles occurring, he was amazed.",
      "ko": "시몬도 믿고 세례를 받은 후에 전심으로 빌립을 따라 다니며 그 나타나는 표적과 큰 능력을 보고 놀라니라",
      "source_text_hash": "b7e2fba2ad13a7e275cec1ebbae18a0857275bdaa8bfa4b6600b14069911c8bc",
