      "en": "As they went on the way, they came to some water; and the eunuch said, “Behold, here is water. What is keeping me from being baptized?”",
      "ko": "길 가다가 물 있는 곳에 이르러 내시가 말하되 보라 물이 있으니 내가 세례를 받음에 무슨 거리낌이 있느뇨",
      "source_text_hash": "5ee20df9b536fd80ac7efdbffa747582521c0d4ce47e028c346450994087f12f",
      "translation_text_hash": "1f6077507c2d14f8fc53fc115c8191cc25bbf7125d44ad529522fabd4ba51f41",
